  "note": "A block passes when the mean credit of its cues (a tap that is hit counts 1, a hold counts the share of its length held) is at least pass_credit. windows_ms are the hit windows around a cue time, hold_complete_s how close to its tail a hold may be released and still count whole. All tunable.",
