  "pass_bonus": 6.0,
  "fail_loss": 7.0,
  "floor_loss_per_miss": 0.0,
  "note": "energy += pass_gain + pass_bonus*(credit-pass_credit)/(1-pass_credit) on a pass, -= fail_loss*(pass_credit-credit)/pass_credit+3 on a fail; it ends the run at 0. Seven blocks in a row at credit 0 are needed to end a run from a fresh start."
